{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>日本天后濱崎步，2000年推出單曲《SEASONS》大賣逾120萬張成為經典。最近，她與Hip Hop男歌手AK-69合唱「令和版」《SEASONS》，更親自操刀，挑戰一鏡到底拍攝MV。</p><p>MV於昨日在網上公開，兩人在東京鐵塔夜景下對唱。48歲的濱崎步，更重現2001年單曲《evolution》的金色短髮、牛仔Tubetop、腰間掛「狐狸尾巴」吊飾的經典造型，勾起不少歌迷的集體回憶。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T07:05:59.188846+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":200,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T13:03:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T10:58:24.780592+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T06:58:47.794267+00:00","content_hash":"a0fd5d29c2a3fa4daebb744aae6236622d778139142a116037e00b0bf015becb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-04T07:05:59.188846+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}